        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012252",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide numerous training programs, which include topics such as operational training, leadership development, customer service and technology training.",
        "start_character": 23155,
        "end_character": 23310
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012252-9e8a2e6ff885367d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012252",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As one of the original participants in the outlet industry and through key additions to our executive, leasing, operating and center teams, we have long-standing relationships with many of our tenants that we believe are critical in operating, managing, developing, and acquiring successful retail centers.",
        "start_character": 6967,
        "end_character": 7273
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012252-9e8a2e6ff885367d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012252",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, the number of entities competing to acquire or develop retail centers has increased and may continue to increase in the future, which could increase demand for these retail centers and the prices we must pay to acquire or develop them.",
        "start_character": 19204,
        "end_character": 19452
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012252-9e8a2e6ff885367d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012252",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The confidence and trust that we have developed with our retail partners from the very beginning has allowed us to forge the impressive retail alliances that we enjoy today with our brands and retailers.",
        "start_character": 4723,
        "end_character": 4926
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012252-9e8a2e6ff885367d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012252",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To generate capital to reinvest into other attractive investment opportunities, we may also consider the use of financial, operational and developmental joint ventures, the sale or lease of outparcels on our existing properties and the sale of certain properties that do not meet our long-term investment criteria.",
        "start_character": 16289,
        "end_character": 16603
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012252-9e8a2e6ff885367d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012252",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a fully-integrated, self-administered and self-managed REIT, which focuses on developing, acquiring, owning, operating and managing outlet and other open-air retail centers.",
        "start_character": 251,
        "end_character": 431
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012252-9e8a2e6ff885367d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012252",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe attracting, developing and retaining talent is critical to our long-term success.",
        "start_character": 22897,
        "end_character": 22989
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012252-9e8a2e6ff885367d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012252",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe our expertise in the outlet and open-air retail industry, extensive development expertise and strong retail relationships give us a distinct competitive advantage.",
        "start_character": 12114,
        "end_character": 12288
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012252-9e8a2e6ff885367d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012252",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "Additionally, we are adding food, beverage, and entertainment options, along with other services, at our centers to attract new shoppers, extend visitor dwell time and increase frequency of visits.",
        "start_character": 8013,
        "end_character": 8210
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012252-9e8a2e6ff885367d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012252",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.88,
        "statement": "Our portfolio also includes one managed center, totaling approximately 457,000 square feet.",
        "start_character": 872,
        "end_character": 963
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012252-9e8a2e6ff885367d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012252",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Because our revenues are ultimately linked to our tenants' success, we are affected by the same competitive factors, such as consumer spending habits, as our tenants.",
